This Workspace file is used to bring in all the required external dependencies and set up global configurations to be used by the entire project.

Many times, developers will need to override teh http_archive calls to develop their building block code locally.
To do this, use the local_repository rule instead.
Comment out the http_archive and copy/paste and update the below local_repository example to match your use case.
Once done with development, remove the local_repository rule, and update the http_archive rule to point to your new
Building Block release.

local_repository(
    name = "ti_arm_1_3_1_windows",
    path = "C:/git/ti-cgt-armllvm_1.3.1.LTS_windows",
)
"""

